WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:03.420
Two, three, four.
Oh, wait.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.631
We almost started
without our special guest!

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:08.717
Helpsters!
- Shaggy!

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:12.846
Helpsters, we start looping
our sounds when Shaggy tells us

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.057
and then stop
when he stops singing.

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:17.559
Sound good?
- Yeah, it does.

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:19.895
Well, I think I'm going to start
with Heart.

00:00:19.895 --> 00:00:25.108
[HEART VOCALIZES]

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:27.069
Scatter!

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:30.530
[SCATTER VOCALIZES]

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.616
Mister Primm!

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:36.578
[MISTER PRIMM VOCALIZES]

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:38.538
I've got to get you in here,
Cody.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.999
[CODY VOCALIZES]

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.626
[ALL VOCALIZING]

00:00:42.626 --> 00:00:47.047
♪ I'm here to say I like
sidewalks under my feet. ♪

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.299
♪ Over the side, a little higher
than the streets. ♪

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:52.094
♪ When I walk,
I prefer a safe location, ♪

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:54.805
♪ so I'm gonna get my feet
some elevation ♪

00:00:54.805 --> 00:00:56.640
♪ with sidewalks. ♪

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.518
♪ Hey, now everybody walk
on the side, ♪

00:00:59.518 --> 00:01:01.019
♪ bounce on the side, ♪

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.647
♪ dance on the side, ♪
♪ eat a snow cone on the side. ♪

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:05.315
♪ Sidewalks. ♪

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:07.818
♪ I'm here to say
I like sidewalks. ♪

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:10.988
♪ Oh, sidewalks. ♪
[VOCALIZING STOPS]

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:13.198
Shaggy!
- Scatter!

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.992
Hey, thanks for making
music with us today.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:16.535
Thank you, my brother.
Big up yourself.

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:17.744
Yeah!

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.997
♪ Helpsters! ♪

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:25.043
♪

